Mods: {
	tsorcRevamp: {
		ActiveShield: {
			Header: "[Active Shield]"
			Defense: Grants {0} defense
			Use: Hold Right Click (with a weapon that has no right-click function) to raise it and fully block frontal hits
			Cost: Each blocked hit costs {0} {1} + {2}% of the damage blocked
			Wall: Stops non-boss enemies from pushing through you
			Break: Running out of {0} mid-block breaks your guard (Ichor, Slow, and a brief stagger)
			Parry: Perfect parry — raise the shield just as a hit lands to block it at half the cost
			Slow: Slows your movement by {0}% while raised
			Chip: An ordinary block leaks {0}% of the damage through as chip damage; a perfect parry leaks none
			Greatshield: Greatshield: no damage leaks through, but it is heavy and slow to recover from
			RegenPenalty: Its weight reduces stamina regeneration by {0}% while equipped
			Regen: Stamina recovers at {0}% of its normal rate while raised, after the usual delay
			Stamina: stamina
			Mana: mana
			ReflectEffect: A perfect parry reflects the blocked damage back at the attacker
			Watchful: Watchful — reveals nearby enemies
			GazeConfuse: A perfect parry may confuse the attacker
			GazePetrify: A perfect parry may confuse or briefly freeze the attacker
			GazeBeam: A perfect parry may confuse/freeze the attacker and fires an eye beam back
			FireCone: A perfect parry breathes fire while the shield stays raised, growing stronger with your defense (costs mana to light and to sustain)
			BulwarkEffect: A perfect parry applies Vulnerability and deflects projectiles
			FrostNova: A perfect parry unleashes a frost nova
			WardPulse: Lowering the ward releases a 360° knockback pulse, stronger the longer held
			WardPulseBolts: Lowering the ward releases a knockback pulse; held 2s+ also looses 3 homing bolts (50 mana)
			DashEffect: Double-tap a direction to dash
		}

		ArcaneSorceryExplanation:
			'''
			[c/ea00ea:Arcane Sorcery: Maximum mana is increased by {0}%, ]
			[c/ea00ea:mana costs are multiplied by {1}, mana regeneration is disabled.]
			[c/ea00ea:Cerulean Flask is buffed to restore {2}x the default and {3}% of your maximum mana, ]
			[c/ea00ea:but drinking the Cerulean Flask stunts your mobility like the Estus Flask.]
			[c/ea00ea:When trying to use a magic weapon under {4}% of your maximum stamina, activate Mana Burn.]
			[c/ea00ea:Mana Burn stops weapons from using stamina, ]
			[c/ea00ea:multiplicatively increases magic damage by {5}% and attack speed by {6}%, ]
			[c/ea00ea:but decreases your Resistance by {7} and multiplies your mana costs by another {8}x.]
			'''
		ElectrocuteExplanation:
			'''
			[c/22dd96:Electrocute: Whenever you hit an enemy with 3 unique ranged projectiles in a span of {0} seconds,]
			[c/22dd96:shock that enemy for the combined damage of those 3 projectiles. ({$CommonItemTooltip.Cooldown@1})]
			[c/22dd96:Uses highest crit chance of the 3 projectiles. ]
			[c/22dd96:Ranged damage is reduced by {2}% while Electrocute is not on cooldown.]
			'''

