			EoW: The Eater of Worlds is ready to feed!
			EoL: The Empress of Light awakens!
			Lunatic: You can't beat what's coming, Red.
			LichKing: The Lich King awakens!
			Hunter: The hunt begins...
			Rage: The Rage awakens!
			AncientDemon: What did you expect to find here human?... Your hubris will be your undoing...
			AncientOolacileDemon: You foolish human... pitiful arrogance...
			GoblinSummoner1: You're arrogant, Red. You were a fool to come here...
			GoblinSummoner2: You think you're clever, Red?
