			SeathTheScaleless: Seath the Scaleless rises!
			WyvernMage: You impress me Red! But this is where your journey ends...
			SlograAndGaibon: Slogra and Gaibon have risen from the depths!
			Serris: The Serris Triplets have been enraged!
