					{$CommonItemTooltip.Thorns}
					'''
			}

			UndeadTalisman: {
				DisplayName: Undead Talisman
				Tooltip: Reduces damage from undead by {0}
			}

			WolfRing: {
				DisplayName: Wolf Ring
				Tooltip:
					'''
					One of the special rings granted to the four knights of Gwyn.
					Press Wolf Ring to massively increase life regen and damage taken temporarily
					Removes the life regen if hit during the effect and puts it on a long cooldown
					Immunity to Blackout, Obstructed, Freezing and Acid Venom
					{$CommonItemTooltip.IncreasesDefenseBy} within the Abyss
					'''
				Keybind1: "Press "
				Keybind2: " to massively increase life regen and damage taken temporarily"
			}

			ZirconRing: {
				DisplayName: Zircon Ring
				Tooltip: "{$CommonItemTooltip.IncreasesMaxLifeByPercent}"
			}

			DragoonCloak: {
				DisplayName: Dragoon Cloak
				Tooltip:
					'''
					Combines the effects of the Dark, Light and Shadowmoon Cloak into one all-powerful protective cloak.
					Life Threshold for empowered effects is {0}%
					A large amount of Dark Souls were used to preserve each cloak's potency.
					'''
			}

			EnchantedMoonCharm: {
				DisplayName: Enchanted Moon Charm
				Tooltip:
					'''
					Changes the phases of the Moon 
					Can trigger blood moons
					'''
				P1: Moon Phase is now Full
				P2: Moon Phase is now Last Gibbous
				P3: Moon Phase is now Last Quarter
				P4: Moon Phase is now Last Crescent
				P5: Moon Phase is now New
				P6: Moon Phase is now First Crescent
				P7: Moon Phase is now First Quarter
				P8: Moon Phase is now First Gibbous
				BloodMoon: The Blood moon has risen...
			}

			BurningAura: {
				DisplayName: Burning Aura
				Tooltip:
					'''
					An array of meteorite shards, floating in a slow orbit
					Passively launches homing fireballs at nearby enemies
					Fireballs scale in power with each boss you kill
					Burning foes take {0}% more damage from other attacks
					'''
			}

			BurningStone: {
				DisplayName: Burning Stone
				Tooltip:
					'''
					A chunk of meteorite, glowing with heat
					Rolling summons a barrage of homing fireballs
					Fireballs scale in power with each boss you kill
					Burning foes take {0}% more damage from other attacks
					'''
				Count: "Current count: "
			}

			ChloranthyRing: {
				DisplayName: Chloranthy Ring I
				Tooltip:
					'''
					{$CommonItemTooltip.StaminaRecovery}
					[c/ffbf00:Enhances your agility and evasiveness when dodge rolling]
					[c/ffbf00:Reduces the movement penalty for holding a shield by 4%]
					[c/ffbf00:Stamina begins recovering 10% sooner after you spend it]
					[c/ffbf00:Increases stamina regeneration while your shield is raised by 10% of its normal rate]
