				Wrong: This item can only be used in the ancient temple ruins at night...
				WrongTime: This item can only be used at night...
			}

			MechanicalSkull: {
				DisplayName: Mechanical Skull
				Tooltip:
					'''
					Summons The Machine, Ancient Warden of the underground.
					You must use this at the end of the Flooded Temple.
