			TheEnd: {
				DisplayName: The End
				Tooltip: This item is from the future, and its text is obscured. You will have to progress further in your adventure to reveal it...
				Obscured:
					'''
					As the burning remains of the Mindflayer King lay before you, you look up and out to the horizon.
					You feel relieved, but notice your heart is still not at peace. Attraidies was known for his games.
					Even in death you suspect his sway over the world has not ended.
					You remember the magic spell that he put on Aaron and wonder if he cast the same spell on himself...
					[c/00ffd4:Looking down, you notice a drill lying in the ashes, still hot to the touch...]
					[c/ffbf00:Congratulations on beating the game! We hope you enjoyed it!- Tim Hjersted & the Revamp Team]
					'''
			}

			VillageMirror: {
				DisplayName: Village Mirror
				Tooltip:
					'''
					Lets you return to Ashen Peak Village at any point.
					Works just like a potion of return, creating a portal that leads back to your old location afterward.
					Equip this in an accessory slot anywhere in the village to create a new warp point.
					Use the mirror to return to that warp point.
					Reduces defense to 0 and slows movement while equipped.
					Teleport takes {0} seconds and you cannot move during the channel.
					'''
			}

