				Name10: Ofi
				Name11: Bompbi
				Quote1: Hello my friend, how are you?
				Quote2: I'm thirsty... would you like to have a drink with me?
				Quote3: We dwarves are very warm and helpful; if you have a problem, you can always come to us without any trouble!
				Quote4: After you defeat the Eater of Worlds, I'll have cheap sticky bombs for sale!
				Quote5: If you're able to defeat The Sorrow or The Destroyer, I'll have more things to sell later...
				Quote6: If you're able to defeat The Sorrow, I'll have more things to sell later...
				Quote7: If you're able to defeat The Destroyer, I'll have more things to sell later...
				ContractButton: Dwarven Contract
				ContractQuote1: Found any Dwarven Contracts yet, traveler?
				ContractQuote2: Bring me one and I’ll send a proper guard to watch over a property, with a gift as a thanks!
				ContractQuote3: If you ever find any old Dwarven Contracts lying around, bring them to me.
				ContractGiven: Thanks for the contract! A dwarf will come to guard a property. Oh yes, and here's your reward!
				FinalContractGiven: You found me every possible contract! Thank you Red for all your hard work, this is your ultimate reward!
				ContractMax: Sorry Red, I've already hired every dwarves willing to work. No more contracts!

