			SolaireOfAstora: {
				DisplayName: Warrior of Sunlight
				Name1: Solaire
				Quote1: Dark Souls possess great powers, but also great responsibilities.
				Quote2: Praise the sun!
				Quote3: Oh, hello there. I will stay behind, to gaze at the sun. The sun is a wondrous body. Like a magnificent father! If only I could be so grossly incandescent!
				Quote4: Of course, we are not the only ones engaged in this.
				Quote5: Would you like to buy some of my wares?
				Quote6:
					'''
					The way I see it, our fates appear to be intertwined. In a land brimming with Hollows, could that really be mere chance? 
					So, what do you say? Why not help one another on this lonely journey?
