			LonelyFairy: {
				DisplayName: Lonely Fairy
				Name1: Aurora
				Name2: Faye
				Name3: Jasmine
				Name4: Lyra
				Name5: Elora
				Quote1: Greetings human, I'm not used to meeting people, as I've been living in the Grove alone for years, but your presence doesn't bother me.
				Quote2: I may have some interesting things to sell you; during my long life I have collected a significant number of souls and various objects.
				Quote3: How old am I? Long enough, I would say... I remember the time when the Empress filled the sky with her light, the fairies captivated by it.
				Quote4: I sense incredible will and kindness in you, little one.
				Quote5: The spirits of nature are stirring, darkness is approaching, but with this comes a glimmer of hope that has never been so bright.
				Quote6: "[c/ffbf00:If you come back after a while, maybe my list of items for sale will grow and it could interest you in your adventure.]"

				TownNPCMood: {
					NoHome: I hate not having a home.
					Content: I am content.
					FarFromHome: I am too far from home.
					LoveSpace: I love having so much space.
					DislikeCrowded: I dislike how crowded I am.
					HateCrowded: I hate how crowded I am.
					LikeNPC_Princess: I like {NPCName}.
					Princess_LovesNPC: I like {NPCName}.
				}

				Census.SpawnCondition: Conditions unknown
			}

